                    <div class="aalto-user-generated-content"><h2><strong>Application periods for studies starting in 2027</strong></h2>
<ol>
<li>Applying to Master's programmes: 7 December 2026 – 5 January 2027</li>
<li>Applying to Bachelor's programmes in English: 7 – 22 January 2027</li>
<li>Applying to Bachelor's programmes in Finnish/Swedish (National joint application, spring 2026): 9 – 23 March 2027</li>
</ol></div>
